WEBVTT

00:03:57.276 --> 00:04:01.196
And I’ve asked them to reflect
on their parenting --

00:04:01.196 --> 00:04:03.556
to think back to how they were brought up,

00:04:03.596 --> 00:04:05.996
and to look forward
to their child’s future.

00:04:07.556 --> 00:04:09.716
Parents told us lots of different stories.

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:12.636
Some of them were finding life hard,

00:04:12.676 --> 00:04:14.196
and we had some tears.

00:04:15.676 --> 00:04:18.556
A fair few wanted
to talk about the risks --

00:04:18.556 --> 00:04:20.556
and those are important

00:04:20.556 --> 00:04:22.196
and they deserve attention,

00:04:22.196 --> 00:04:23.956
which they get elsewhere,

00:04:23.956 --> 00:04:25.356
including from me.

00:04:26.036 --> 00:04:27.036
But some --

00:04:27.036 --> 00:04:28.836
and this may seem more surprising --

00:04:28.836 --> 00:04:33.636
some were calm and confident
about their children’s digital lives.